{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017t1MMecLhUMnxAzrqWx9dW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have enough context from the existing data to ground the predictions. Let me synthesize the best-tier predictions for every planned experiment.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  D038 framing完全成立。三条claim均可保持原始强度。Lead with per-benchmark γ_k\n  异质性作为novel empirical finding（ARC负/MMLU正/GSM8K≈0），calibration improvement\n  作为practical demonstration。关键转折：N≥16 multi-seed pooling解决了N=8时的\n  convergence崩塌问题（MMLU从rhat=1.54降至<1.01），coverage从0.18-0.63升至0.50-0.75。\n  S2(Min-K++)在1.5B恢复到AUC≥0.65使RRF不再退化为S1-only，Min-K++方向反转\n  在d100条件下的cautionary finding保留。Fisher Info理论阈值AUC≥0.70与实证吻合，\n  为identifiability claim提供closed-form grounding。论文结构：§3 signal characterization\n  (C2, 最citation-worthy)，§4 IRT calibration with γ_k heterogeneity (C1)，\n  §5 Fisher Info identifiability bounds (C3)。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"stage1_signal_pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      在exp-001所有contaminated+clean模型上计算4个detection signal:\n      S1 embedding retrieval, S2 Min-K++, S3 ConStat, S4 Self-Critique。\n      0.5B已完成(exp_002_signals_05B)。此处预测1.5B和3B的完整结果。\n    expected_results:\n      # 0.5B 已有实际数据，直接引用\n      S1_embedding_auc_05B_d005: 0.975\n      S2_minkpp_auc_05B_d005: 0.465\n      S4_selfcritique_auc_05B_d005: 0.481\n      # 1.5B 预测（best档：S2恢复）\n      S1_embedding_auc_15B_d005: 0.982\n      S2_minkpp_auc_15B_d005: 0.68\n      S3_constat_auc_15B_d005: 0.72\n      S4_selfcritique_auc_15B_d005: 0.55\n      # 3B 预测（best档：S2进一步提升）\n      S1_embedding_auc_3B_d005: 0.988\n      S2_minkpp_auc_3B_d005: 0.74\n      S3_constat_auc_3B_d005: 0.78\n      S4_selfcritique_auc_3B_d005: 0.62\n      # d100 cross-model Cohen's d（方向反转保留）\n      S2_minkpp_cohens_d_05B_d100: -1.98  # 实际数据\n      S2_minkpp_cohens_d_15B_d100: -1.45\n      S2_minkpp_cohens_d_3B_d100: -0.82\n      effective_signals_05B: 1\n      effective_signals_15B: 2  # S1+S2\n      effective_signals_3B: 3  # S1+S2+S3\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档核心假设之一是S2(Min-K++)在1.5B/3B恢复到AUC≥0.65。\n      理论依据：Min-K++依赖模型对training data的memorization程度，\n      0.5B参数量不足以在SFT后产生足够的perplexity差异（capacity bottleneck），\n      但1.5B/3B有3-6×参数量，memorization capacity线性增长，\n      足以在contaminated items上产生可检测的perplexity drop。\n      0.5B已观测到S2 AUC=0.465（chance level），这与文献中\n      Carlini et al. 2022报告的\"小模型MIA near-chance\"一致。\n      1.5B跨过capacity threshold后S2恢复到0.68是合理的——\n      MIA文献（Shokri 2017）在1-3B参数量模型上报告AUC 0.6-0.8。\n      S2的Cohen's d方向反转在d100条件下随scale减弱（从-1.98到-0.82），\n      因为更大的模型对massive contamination的distributional shift更鲁棒。\n      ConStat(S3)在1.5B/3B恢复是因为paraphrase gap在较大模型上\n      更稳定（1.5B eval数据已显示MC benchmarks <1pp gap，但3B有更清晰的pattern）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Signal AUC × Scale × Dosage Matrix\"\n        columns: [Signal, Scale, d005_AUC, d025_AUC, d100_Cohen_d]\n        rows:\n          - [S1_Embedding, 0.5B, 0.975, 0.96, 3.60]\n          - [S1_Embedding, 1.5B, 0.982, 0.97, 4.16]\n          - [S1_Embedding, 3B, 0.988, 0.98, 4.50]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, 0.5B, 0.465, 0.48, -1.98]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, 1.5B, 0.68, 0.71, -1.45]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, 3B, 0.74, 0.76, -0.82]\n          - [S3_ConStat, 1.5B, 0.72, 0.74, 2.10]\n          - [S3_ConStat, 3B, 0.78, 0.80, 2.85]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 0.5B, 0.481, 0.49, 0.45]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 1.5B, 0.55, 0.58, 0.90]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 3B, 0.62, 0.65, 1.30]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Signal × Scale AUC heatmap (4 signals × 3 scales), d005条件。颜色从红(0.5)到绿(1.0)。S1全列深绿，S2从红(0.5B)渐变到黄绿(3B)，S3类似但起点更高，S4始终偏黄。右侧标注effective_signals count。\"\n    analysis: >\n      S2在1.5B/3B恢复证实scale-dependent假设成立。S1始终dominant(AUC>0.97)，\n      S2恢复后RRF不再退化为S1-only。Min-K++方向反转随scale减弱但不消失——\n      这是社区级cautionary finding：即使在3B，d100条件下Min-K++仍然misleading。\n      C2 claim可保持\"scale-dependent\"措辞。\n\n  - name: \"rrf_aggregation_ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      RRF融合4个信号为composite exposure score。含ablation:\n      RRF vs equal-weight, single-signal ×4, calibration-based weighted RRF,\n      FP injection robustness, degraded 2-signal mode。\n    expected_results:\n      rrf_4signal_auc_15B_d005: 0.985\n      rrf_4signal_auc_3B_d005: 0.990\n      rrf_3signal_auc_05B_d005: 0.970  # 已有 exp_003_rrf_05B\n      s1_only_auc_15B_d005: 0.982\n      s1_only_auc_3B_d005: 0.988\n      rrf_vs_s1only_delta_auc_15B: 0.003\n      rrf_vs_s1only_delta_auc_3B: 0.002\n      rrf_vs_equal_weight_delta_auc: 0.005\n      fp_injection_10pct_auc_drop: 0.02\n      fp_injection_20pct_auc_drop: 0.06\n      degraded_2signal_auc_15B: 0.74\n      degraded_2signal_auc_3B: 0.79\n      rrf_rank_correlation_vs_oracle: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      RRF的marginal gain over S1-only较小（+0.003 at 1.5B），因为S1已经\n      near-perfect(0.982)。RRF的价值不在于AUC提升，而在于：(1)当S1\n      偶尔失败时（某些item类型）S2/S3提供backup，(2)FP injection实验\n      显示RRF在10%FP下仅降2pp而S1-only降4pp——鲁棒性优势。\n      Equal-weight rank averaging比RRF差5pp因为给了near-chance信号\n      （S4 at 0.5B）过多权重。Degraded 2-signal mode（ConStat+SelfCritique，\n      无embeddings/logits）在1.5B达0.74是合理的——没有S1这个dominant signal，\n      两个较弱信号的融合上限受限。这为closed-weight场景提供了honest baseline。\n      meta-circularity argument成立：即使RRF≈S1-only，training-free设计\n      避免了aggregator本身被contaminated data影响的风险。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RRF Ablation Results\"\n        columns: [Method, 0.5B_AUC, 1.5B_AUC, 3B_AUC, FP_10pct_drop]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF_4signal, 0.970, 0.985, 0.990, 0.02]\n          - [S1_only, 0.975, 0.982, 0.988, 0.04]\n          - [S2_only, 0.465, 0.680, 0.740, 0.03]\n          - [S3_only, \"N/A\", 0.720, 0.780, 0.05]\n          - [S4_only, 0.481, 0.550, 0.620, 0.08]\n          - [Equal_weight, 0.820, 0.910, 0.940, 0.03]\n          - [Degraded_2sig, \"N/A\", 0.740, 0.790, 0.06]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"FP injection robustness curve: x轴FP rate (0-30%), y轴AUC retention。RRF线最平稳，S1-only次之，equal-weight和single弱信号下降最快。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF在best档下充分发挥作用——虽然marginal AUC gain小，但robustness\n      和principled aggregation的argument成立。论文positioning: RRF是design choice\n      (not contribution)，meta-circularity是justification。Degraded 2-signal\n      结果为closed-weight extension提供baseline。\n\n  - name: \"irt_calibration_and_baselines\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS) on controlled models。N≥16 multi-seed pooling。\n      Per-benchmark γ_k fitting + joint fitting ablation。7 baselines。\n      6 evaluation metrics。3 seeds mean±std。\n    expected_results:\n      # Per-benchmark gamma (N=24, 3 scales × 4 dosages × 2 seeds)\n      gamma_mmlu_mean: 0.85\n      gamma_mmlu_ci: [0.32, 1.42]\n      gamma_mmlu_excludes_zero: true\n      gamma_arc_mean: -1.65\n      gamma_arc_ci: [-2.80, -0.55]\n      gamma_arc_excludes_zero: true\n      gamma_gsm8k_mean: 0.08\n      gamma_gsm8k_ci: [-0.28, 0.42]\n      gamma_gsm8k_excludes_zero: false  # negative control\n      gamma_humaneval_mean: 1.92\n      gamma_humaneval_ci: [0.85, 3.10]\n      gamma_humaneval_excludes_zero: true\n      # MCMC diagnostics\n      rhat_max_mmlu: 1.005\n      rhat_max_arc: 1.004\n      rhat_max_gsm8k: 1.008\n      ess_min_mmlu: 650\n      ess_min_arc: 820\n      ess_min_gsm8k: 480\n      convergence_rate: 0.92  # 11/12 fits converge (3 benchmarks × 2 models × 2 seeds, GSM8K joint may wobble)\n      # Calibration metrics (contaminated conditions only, d005/d025/d100)\n      mae_irt_4pl_gamma_pp: 3.2\n      mae_raw_pp: 5.8\n      mae_improvement_over_raw_pp: 2.6\n      mae_linear_regression_pp: 4.1\n      mae_dcr_fuzzy_pp: 14.5\n      mae_vanilla_4pl_pp: 5.5\n      mae_remove_rescore_pp: 5.2\n      mae_emperor_pp: 5.6\n      mae_2pl_gamma_pp: 4.8\n      # Coverage\n      coverage_95_irt: 0.62\n      coverage_80_irt: 0.45\n      coverage_50_irt: 0.28\n      coverage_95_raw: 0.35\n      # Sharpness\n      sharpness_95_irt_pp: 8.5\n      # Ranking\n      kendall_tau_irt: 0.82\n      kendall_tau_raw: 0.68\n      kendall_tau_linear: 0.75\n      # Cross-seed gamma stability\n      gamma_cross_seed_r_arc: 0.92\n      gamma_cross_seed_r_mmlu: 0.88\n      gamma_cross_seed_r_gsm8k: 0.45  # low because near-zero, noise dominates\n      # SBC diagnostic\n      sbc_rank_uniformity_p: 0.12  # marginal, not perfect\n      sbc_coverage_gap_source: \"local_independence_violation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=8时MMLU完全崩塌(rhat=1.54, ess=7)、ARC coverage=62.5%、GSM8K coverage=31%。\n      best档假设N≥16 multi-seed pooling解决convergence——理论依据：\n      (1) sim sweep已证实N=50时coverage稳定在95%+，N=20时仍有~85%；\n      (2) 从N=8到N=24增加3×数据点，item参数估计大幅改善；\n      (3) 1.5B/3B加入pooling后theta分布更连续，解决了\"只有两个能力水平\"的问题。\n      \n      MMLU gamma=0.85正向显著：contamination确实inflate MMLU accuracy（已知pattern，\n      paraphrase gap在3B d100显示+3.5pp）。但效应不极端——MMLU是14K items，\n      contamination效应被大量clean items稀释。\n      \n      ARC gamma=-1.65负向显著：catastrophic forgetting at small scale。\n      0.5B d100 ARC accuracy暴跌17.5pp(s42)/-10.2pp(s123)是strongest evidence。\n      3B d100仅-1pp说明forgetting是scale-dependent，但pooled模型中\n      0.5B的极端forgetting驱动整体gamma为负。\n      \n      GSM8K gamma≈0是perfect negative control：open-ended tasks的\n      contamination不通过MC accuracy体现（再分配型效应，非加法型）。\n      oracle实验已显示gamma=3.77但overcorrects 21×——在best档下，\n      multi-seed pooling + 3B data可能将gamma压到接近0，\n      因为3B scale下GSM8K的contamination effect确实near-zero。\n      \n      MAE improvement 2.6pp over raw是在contaminated conditions(d005/d025/d100)\n      上取均值。ARC和MMLU各贡献~1-3pp improvement（因为gamma显著且校正方向正确），\n      GSM8K近零（gamma≈0不校正，MAE≈raw），HumanEval贡献最多但item数少。\n      \n      Coverage 62%虽远低于95%名义值，但比N=8时的18-33%有实质改善。\n      SBC诊断将gap归因于local independence violation——\n      单模型产生所有item response违反IRT基本假设，\n      这是结构性limitation而非N不足，在Limitations中充分讨论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Per-benchmark γ_k Estimates (N=24, Multi-seed Pooled)\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, γ_mean, \"95% CI\", Excludes_Zero, Direction, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.85, \"[0.32, 1.42]\", \"Yes\", Positive, \"Contamination inflates MC accuracy\"]\n          - [ARC-Challenge, -1.65, \"[-2.80, -0.55]\", \"Yes\", Negative, \"Catastrophic forgetting at small scale\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.08, \"[-0.28, 0.42]\", \"No\", \"≈Zero\", \"Negative control: no MC inflation\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 1.92, \"[0.85, 3.10]\", \"Yes\", Positive, \"Strong inflation on code generation\"]\n      - name: \"Calibration Error Comparison (MAE, pp) — Contaminated Conditions\"\n        columns: [Method, MMLU, ARC, GSM8K, HumanEval, Mean]\n        rows:\n          - [IRT_4PL_gamma, 2.8, 3.5, 0.8, 5.7, 3.2]\n          - [B0_Raw, 4.2, 8.8, 0.5, 9.5, 5.8]\n          - [B1_Remove_Rescore, 3.9, 7.5, 0.6, 8.8, 5.2]\n          - [B2_2PL_gamma, 3.8, 5.2, 1.2, 9.0, 4.8]\n          - [B3_Vanilla_4PL, 4.0, 7.8, 0.6, 9.5, 5.5]\n          - [B4_Linear_Reg, 3.2, 4.8, 0.5, 7.8, 4.1]\n          - [B5_Emperor, 4.1, 8.5, 0.5, 9.2, 5.6]\n          - [B6_DCR_Fuzzy, 12.0, 15.5, 8.2, 22.0, 14.5]\n      - name: \"Coverage and Ranking Metrics\"\n        columns: [Method, C95, C80, C50, Sharpness_95_pp, Kendall_tau]\n        rows:\n          - [IRT_4PL_gamma, 0.62, 0.45, 0.28, 8.5, 0.82]\n          - [B0_Raw, 0.35, 0.25, 0.15, \"N/A\", 0.68]\n          - [B4_Linear_Reg, 0.55, 0.40, 0.22, 12.0, 0.75]\n          - [B6_DCR_Fuzzy, 0.20, 0.15, 0.08, 25.0, 0.45]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Calibrated-vs-true accuracy scatter plot with 95% CI bars。每个点是一个model×benchmark组合。IRT点密集分布在y=x线附近，raw baseline系统性偏离。ARC的负校正（向上校正forgetting）和MMLU的正校正（向下校正inflation）方向清晰可见。\"\n      - \"Dose-response monotonicity curve：x轴dosage(0/5/25/100%)，y轴|gamma_effect|。MMLU和ARC呈单调递增，GSM8K平坦在0附近。\"\n      - \"Per-benchmark gamma forest plot：4个benchmark的gamma estimate + 95% CI并排展示，零线标注。ARC在左(负)，GSM8K跨零，MMLU和HumanEval在右(正)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C1 calibration claim在best档下fully supported：IRT在γ显著的benchmark\n      (ARC/MMLU/HumanEval)上MAE improvement 1.4-3.8pp over raw。GSM8K作为\n      negative control被正确识别为不需要校准（gamma≈0）。Coverage 62%虽不达\n      名义95%，但比raw(35%)和DCR(20%)显著改善。Kendall τ=0.82说明ranking\n      preservation良好。γ_k异质性pattern跨seed稳定(r≥0.85 for ARC/MMLU)，\n      支撑\"contamination susceptibility is a benchmark property\"的novel finding。\n      Joint model with shared global γ作为ablation会显示γ≈0（被ARC负和MMLU正抵消），\n      进一步证明per-benchmark fitting的必要性。\n\n  - name: \"simulation_identifiability_sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      144条件systematic sweep (AUC × N_models × prior × exposure_type)。\n      v5当前RUNNING。Fisher Info理论阈值与实证对比。\n    expected_results:\n      # γ recovery across key conditions\n      gamma_rmse_auc055_n20: 0.18\n      gamma_rmse_auc055_n50: 0.11\n      gamma_rmse_auc055_n100: 0.04\n      gamma_rmse_auc070_n20: 0.12\n      gamma_rmse_auc070_n50: 0.06\n      gamma_rmse_auc070_n100: 0.025\n      gamma_rmse_auc080_n50: 0.03\n      gamma_rmse_auc090_n100: 0.015\n      # Coverage\n      coverage_95_auc055_n20: 0.78\n      coverage_95_auc055_n50: 0.88\n      coverage_95_auc070_n20: 0.85\n      coverage_95_auc070_n50: 0.93\n      coverage_95_auc070_n100: 0.96\n      coverage_95_auc080_n50: 0.95\n      coverage_95_auc090_n100: 0.97\n      # CI width scaling\n      ci_width_n20_auc070_pp: 12.5\n      ci_width_n50_auc070_pp: 7.8\n      ci_width_n100_auc070_pp: 5.5\n      ci_width_n200_auc070_pp: 3.9\n      ci_width_ratio_n50_n100: 1.42  # close to sqrt(2)=1.41\n      # Fisher Info thresholds\n      fisher_structural_identifiability_auc: 0.55\n      fisher_practical_identifiability_auc: 0.70\n      fisher_reliable_estimation_auc: 0.80\n      fisher_theory_empirical_concordance: 0.93  # correlation between predicted and observed RMSE\n      # Prior sensitivity\n      prior_sensitivity_ratio_weak_strong: 1.35  # N(0,2) vs N(0,0.5) at N=50\n      prior_sensitivity_at_n200: 1.05  # negligible at large N\n      # theta correlation\n      theta_corr_auc070_n50: 0.955\n      theta_corr_auc080_n100: 0.975\n      # Growing Pains pre-estimation\n      gp_preest_coverage_improvement_n20: 0.08  # +8pp coverage vs flat prior\n      # Convergence\n      divergent_rate_overall: 0.02\n      max_rhat_95th_percentile: 1.008\n      runs_completed: 120\n      runs_total: 120\n    result_rationale: >\n      v1-v4均failed（实现bug、超时、配置错误），但v2的48/120已完成runs\n      提供了ground truth：AUC=0.55/N=100条件下bias=0.006, RMSE=0.03, coverage=100%。\n      v5在best档下全部120 runs完成。\n      \n      Fisher Info理论推导：I(γ) ∝ N_models × Σ_items [exposure_variance × \n      item_discrimination² × f(theta)]。当AUC=0.55时exposure variance极小\n      （signal barely above chance），I(γ)接近singular——结构可识别但实际\n      estimation unreliable（RMSE=0.18 at N=20）。AUC=0.70是拐点：\n      exposure variance足够大使得I(γ)的95% CI width降到可用范围(<15pp at N=50)。\n      这与实证完全吻合——AUC 0.55→0.70从RMSE 0.11→0.06 at N=50。\n      \n      CI width follows 1/√N scaling（v2已观测ratio=2.04 vs theory=2.24，\n      偏差来自non-Gaussian posterior at small N）。在best档下N=200条件\n      补充后full scaling curve可做。Prior sensitivity在N≥100后negligible(ratio 1.05)，\n      说明data dominates prior——但N=20时仍有35% sensitivity，\n      Growing Pains pre-estimation可弥补8pp coverage。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Identifiability Phase Diagram: γ RMSE\"\n        columns: [AUC, N=20, N=50, N=100, N=200]\n        rows:\n          - [0.55, 0.18, 0.11, 0.04, 0.025]\n          - [0.60, 0.15, 0.09, 0.035, 0.020]\n          - [0.65, 0.13, 0.07, 0.030, 0.018]\n          - [0.70, 0.12, 0.06, 0.025, 0.015]\n          - [0.80, 0.08, 0.03, 0.015, 0.010]\n          - [0.90, 0.05, 0.02, 0.010, 0.007]\n      - name: \"95% Coverage across Conditions\"\n        columns: [AUC, N=20, N=50, N=100, N=200]\n        rows:\n          - [0.55, 0.78, 0.88, 0.95, 0.97]\n          - [0.70, 0.85, 0.93, 0.96, 0.98]\n          - [0.80, 0.90, 0.95, 0.97, 0.98]\n          - [0.90, 0.92, 0.96, 0.97, 0.98]\n      - name: \"Fisher Info Theory vs Empirical\"\n        columns: [AUC, Predicted_RMSE_N50, Observed_RMSE_N50, Ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [0.55, 0.12, 0.11, 0.92]\n          - [0.70, 0.065, 0.06, 0.92]\n          - [0.80, 0.032, 0.03, 0.94]\n          - [0.90, 0.018, 0.02, 1.11]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Identifiability phase diagram heatmap: x轴N_models(20-200), y轴AUC(0.55-0.90), 颜色=γ RMSE。左下角深红(不可靠), 右上角深蓝(精确)。虚线标注structural(AUC=0.55)和practical(AUC=0.70)阈值。Fisher Info理论等高线叠加，与实证heatmap高度吻合。\"\n      - \"CI width vs 1/√N scaling plot: log-log坐标，实测点与理论√N线对比。AUC=0.70和0.80两条线几乎平行于理论线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C3 identifiability claim在best档下fully grounded。Fisher Info推导\n      提供了closed-form relationship: AUC≥0.55 structural, ≥0.70 practical,\n      ≥0.80 reliable。理论与实证concordance r=0.93。\n      这是论文最强的理论贡献——reviewer concern #1直接回答。\n      Coverage在N=24(实际pooled size)和AUC=0.97(S1 actual)条件下\n      理论预测~96%，实测62%的gap可归因于local independence violation\n      （simulation用independent examinees，实际是single model）。\n\n  - name: \"noise_propagation_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      Measurement error model + post-hoc noise injection。v4已完成（negative result：\n      CI对sigma_e不敏感）。best档下ME model在real data上有不同表现。\n    expected_results:\n      # Analytic ME model (simulation, confirmed negative from v4)\n      me_ci_width_range_sim: \"0.0997-0.1000\"\n      me_ci_sigma_e_monotonicity_rho_sim: 0.4\n      me_ci_sigma_e_monotonicity_p_sim: 0.50\n      # ME model on real data (best档：real exposure noise structure matters)\n      me_coverage_improvement_real_data_pp: 5\n      me_coverage_95_real: 0.67\n      me_vs_simple_coverage_95: 0.62\n      # Post-hoc noise injection\n      noise_1x_gamma_ci_widening_pct: 8\n      noise_1p5x_gamma_ci_widening_pct: 15\n      noise_2x_gamma_ci_widening_pct: 28\n      noise_2x_gamma_still_significant: true\n      noise_2x_coverage_change_pp: 3\n    result_rationale: >\n      v4已明确：analytic ME model在simulation中CI对sigma_e不敏感（rho=0.4, p=0.50）。\n      这是因为在simulation中exposure noise是symmetric Gaussian——\n      ME model的latent τ可以完美absorb这种noise without widening CI。\n      \n      best档预测：在real data上ME model有marginal improvement(+5pp coverage)，\n      因为real exposure noise不是symmetric——S2/S4在0.5B near-chance\n      产生的noise是truncated/skewed的，ME model的latent τ可以\n      partial correct for这种asymmetric noise pattern。\n      但improvement modest——ME作为ablation报告而非primary model。\n      \n      Post-hoc noise injection在2×matched noise下gamma CI宽28%\n      但仍然significant（对ARC/MMLU），证明IRT对moderate signal noise robust。\n      这支撑C3的uncertainty propagation narrative：models with degraded signals\n      appropriately get wider CIs。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Noise Injection Effect on γ Estimation\"\n        columns: [Noise_Level, γ_CI_Width_pp, γ_Still_Significant, Coverage_95]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0× (baseline)\", 2.1, \"Yes (ARC/MMLU)\", 0.62]\n          - [\"1× matched\", 2.3, \"Yes\", 0.63]\n          - [\"1.5× matched\", 2.4, \"Yes\", 0.64]\n          - [\"2× matched\", 2.7, \"Yes (marginal for MMLU)\", 0.65]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"CI width vs noise level line plot: 平坦线说明IRT对moderate noise robust。标注'practical operating range'在1-1.5×区间。\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-005核心结论：ME model是marginal improvement，不是primary贡献。\n      论文中report为ablation (\"ME model improves coverage by ~5pp\")，\n      primary model用simple exposure without ME。Post-hoc noise injection\n      证明robustness，支撑C3 uncertainty propagation narrative。\n      v4的negative result（CI不敏感）本身是有价值的finding——\n      说明IRT框架inherently robust to moderate signal noise。\n\n  - name: \"signal_survival_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      Signal × scale × dosage AUC heatmap。4 signals × {base, SFT-clean,\n      SFT-contaminated}。0.5B v4已完成。扩展到1.5B/3B + Instruct proxy。\n    expected_results:\n      # 0.5B (actual data from v4)\n      S1_d005_auc_05B_mmlu: 0.953\n      S1_d005_auc_05B_gsm8k: 0.988\n      S1_d005_auc_05B_arc: 0.995\n      S2_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.465\n      S4_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.481\n      S1_d100_cohens_d_05B_mean: 3.60\n      S2_d100_cohens_d_05B_mean: -1.98\n      # 1.5B (best档预测)\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.965\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.991\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.996\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.70\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.66\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.72\n      S4_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.56\n      S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: -1.40\n      # 3B (best档预测)\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.972\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.993\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.997\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.76\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.72\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.78\n      S4_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.63\n      S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: -0.85\n      # Instruct proxy (RL observational)\n      S1_instruct_vs_base_cohens_d_05B: 0.35\n      S4_instruct_vs_base_cohens_d_05B: 0.82\n      # Summary\n      effective_signals_05B: 1\n      effective_signals_15B: 2\n      effective_signals_3B: 3\n      min_kpp_reversal_universal: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      0.5B v4数据已确认：S1 dominant(AUC>0.95), S2/S4 near-chance。\n      best档核心假设：1.5B/3B S2恢复。\n      \n      S2(Min-K++)恢复的机制：Min-K++计算token-level surprise，\n      contaminated items的tokens应该有lower surprise（model记住了）。\n      0.5B因为capacity不足，SFT后的perplexity landscape对所有items\n      都有类似shift，discriminability丧失。1.5B/3B有足够capacity\n      selective memorize contaminated items而不disturb全局perplexity pattern。\n      \n      S2方向反转(negative Cohen's d)在d100条件下跨scale持续存在但减弱：\n      d100 = 100% items contaminated → 所有items的perplexity都降低 →\n      Min-K++的ranking反转（contaminated items的K-min tokens反而更高\n      因为model对所有tokens都familiar）。更大模型capacity足以\n      maintain部分discrimination所以d减弱，但反转direction不变。\n      \n      S4(Self-Critique)在3B达0.63——仍低于0.65 threshold但接近。\n      S4依赖model生成和评估paraphrase的能力，3B的生成质量\n      接近但不完全满足self-critique需求。\n      \n      Instruct proxy数据：S4对RL-trained models有differential signal\n      (Cohen's d=0.82)因为Instruct models的self-critique能力\n      本身就更强，提供了detection的indirect channel。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Signal Survival Heatmap — Within-model AUC at d005\"\n        columns: [Signal, 0.5B_MMLU, 0.5B_ARC, 1.5B_MMLU, 1.5B_ARC, 3B_MMLU, 3B_ARC]\n        rows:\n          - [S1_Embedding, 0.953, 0.995, 0.965, 0.996, 0.972, 0.997]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, 0.465, 0.466, 0.700, 0.720, 0.760, 0.780]\n          - [S3_ConStat, \"N/A\", \"N/A\", 0.720, 0.740, 0.780, 0.800]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 0.517, 0.433, 0.560, 0.570, 0.640, 0.650]\n      - name: \"Cross-model Cohen's d at d100 (direction reversal)\"\n        columns: [Signal, 0.5B, 1.5B, 3B, Direction]\n        rows:\n          - [S1_Embedding, 3.60, 4.16, 4.50, Positive]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, -1.98, -1.40, -0.85, \"Negative (REVERSAL)\"]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 0.45, 0.90, 1.30, Positive]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paper Figure 2: Signal × Scale AUC heatmap。6列(3 scales × 2 benchmarks), 4行(signals)。颜色编码：dark green ≥0.90, yellow-green 0.65-0.90, orange 0.55-0.65, red <0.55。S1行全绿，S2从红渐变到黄绿（scale-dependent recovery清晰可见），S4从红到橙。右侧标注effective_signals count per scale。\"\n      - \"Min-K++ direction reversal scatter: d100 Cohen's d vs model scale, 三个点连线showing reversal magnitude decreasing with scale。Annotation解释reversal mechanism。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C2 signal characterization是论文most citation-worthy finding。\n      三个层次的novelty：(1) scale-dependent signal effectiveness——\n      S2从chance(0.5B)到useful(3B)的recovery curve是community新发现；\n      (2) Min-K++ reversal——方向反转而非仅仅fail，这是强cautionary finding；\n      (3) item-level vs model-level detection distinction（within-model AUC vs\n      cross-model Cohen's d）是方法论贡献。\n\n  - name: \"scale_bridging_7b\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 5 dosage levels。\n      验证calibration accuracy scales to larger models。\n    expected_results:\n      # Benchmark accuracy (d000 baseline)\n      mmlu_7b_d000: 0.735\n      gsm8k_7b_d000: 0.795\n      arc_7b_d000: 0.885\n      humaneval_7b_d000: 0.35\n      # Contamination effects\n      mmlu_7b_d100: 0.752  # +1.7pp inflation (moderate)\n      arc_7b_d100: 0.870  # -1.5pp (mild forgetting, much less than 0.5B)\n      gsm8k_7b_d100: 0.798 # +0.3pp (near zero, negative control holds)\n      humaneval_7b_d100: 0.52 # +17pp (strong dose-response preserved)\n      # Gamma estimates (per-benchmark, pooled with 0.5B/1.5B/3B)\n      gamma_mmlu_7b_pooled: 0.92\n      gamma_arc_7b_pooled: -1.20  # less negative than without 7B (7B has mild forgetting)\n      gamma_gsm8k_7b_pooled: 0.05\n      # Signal quality at 7B\n      S1_auc_7b_d005: 0.990\n      S2_auc_7b_d005: 0.82\n      S4_auc_7b_d005: 0.71\n      effective_signals_7b: 3\n      # Calibration with 7B included (N=32 total)\n      mae_with_7b_pp: 2.8\n      coverage_95_with_7b: 0.68\n      kendall_tau_with_7b: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      7B是capacity sweet spot：足够大使得S2/S4全部恢复(AUC>0.7)，\n      但SFT contamination effect依然measurable。\n      \n      MMLU inflation仅+1.7pp（vs 3B的+0.8pp）：随scale增大，\n      base knowledge足以回答MMLU大部分questions，contamination的\n      marginal gain递减。ARC forgetting从0.5B的-17.5pp大幅缩减到\n      -1.5pp——7B的reasoning capacity不会因为SFT on MC items而崩塌。\n      \n      将7B纳入pooling将total N推到~32（4 scales × 4 dosages × 2 seeds），\n      进一步改善convergence。Coverage从62%(N=24)升到68%(N=32)——\n      consistent with sim sweep的N scaling curve。\n      \n      S2 AUC=0.82 at 7B是重要验证：MIA effectiveness确实\n      monotonically increase with model scale，支撑\"scale-dependent\"叙事。\n      3个effective signals使RRF真正发挥multi-signal fusion价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"7B Dose-Response Profile\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, d000, d005, d025, d100, \"Δ(d100-d000)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.735, 0.737, 0.742, 0.752, +1.7pp]\n          - [ARC, 0.885, 0.883, 0.878, 0.870, -1.5pp]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.795, 0.796, 0.797, 0.798, +0.3pp]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.350, 0.375, 0.420, 0.520, +17.0pp]\n      - name: \"Signal Quality at 7B Scale\"\n        columns: [Signal, d005_AUC, d100_Cohen_d, Effective]\n        rows:\n          - [S1_Embedding, 0.990, 5.10, \"Yes\"]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, 0.820, -0.50, \"Yes (reversed at d100)\"]\n          - [S3_ConStat, 0.850, 3.40, \"Yes\"]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 0.710, 1.65, \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scale-dependent ARC forgetting bar chart: x轴model scale(0.5B/1.5B/3B/7B), y轴Δaccuracy at d100。从-17.5pp到-1.5pp的dramatic recovery curve。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B数据strengthen all three claims。C1: coverage+3pp, MAE-0.4pp。\n      C2: effective_signals=3 at 7B validates scale-dependent hypothesis across\n      full scale range。C3: Fisher Info predicts AUC=0.82 yields RMSE≈0.02——\n      7B实际RMSE应接近。Addresses reviewer concern #4 directly。\n\n  - name: \"rl_observational_case_study\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      Apply signals to RL-trained models (Instruct variants + DeepSeek-R1-Distill)。\n      Expected regret quantification。Near-zero γ check on clean benchmark。\n    expected_results:\n      # Signal application to Instruct models\n      S1_auc_instruct_05B: 0.62  # degraded vs SFT (RL changes embedding space)\n      S1_auc_instruct_15B: 0.58\n      S1_auc_instruct_3B: 0.65\n      S1_auc_instruct_7B: 0.72\n      S4_auc_instruct_05B: 0.68  # Self-Critique relatively robust to RL\n      S4_auc_instruct_3B: 0.74\n      S4_auc_instruct_7B: 0.78\n      # IRT fitting on RL models\n      gamma_instruct_mmlu: 0.35\n      gamma_instruct_mmlu_ci: [-0.15, 0.88]\n      gamma_instruct_arc: -0.22\n      gamma_instruct_arc_ci: [-0.75, 0.30]\n      gamma_instruct_gsm8k: 0.12\n      gamma_instruct_gsm8k_ci: [-0.35, 0.60]\n      # CI widths (appropriately wider)\n      ci_width_instruct_pp: 15.2\n      ci_width_sft_controlled_pp: 8.5\n      ci_width_ratio_instruct_vs_sft: 1.79\n      # Expected regret (top-5 model selection)\n      regret_uncalibrated_top5: 3.8\n      regret_calibrated_top5: 2.1\n      regret_remove_rescore_top5: 3.5\n      regret_reduction_pct: 45\n      # Near-zero γ check (specificity)\n      gamma_clean_benchmark_mean: 0.04\n      gamma_clean_benchmark_ci_includes_zero: true\n      # DeepSeek-R1-Distill\n      deepseek_r1_gamma_mmlu: 0.28\n      deepseek_r1_ci_width_pp: 18.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      RL observational case study的核心challenge：RL changes embedding space，\n      degrading S1(embedding-based)从SFT的0.97+降到0.58-0.72。\n      但S4(Self-Critique)在RL models上反而更effective——\n      RL-trained models有更好的instruction following，\n      Self-Critique prompting更reliably执行。\n      \n      best档下gamma estimates对Instruct models偏小且CI宽：\n      (1) Instruct models的contamination来自pre-training，不是controlled injection，\n      所以exposure unknown且noisy；(2) RL training可能已经partially wash out\n      pre-training contamination effects。CI宽1.79×是appropriate——\n      honest uncertainty propagation，不是failure。\n      \n      Expected regret reduction 45%是significant practical result：\n      在top-5 model selection task中，calibrated ranking避免了\n      选择contamination-inflated models。即使individual CIs宽，\n      relative ranking仍然informative。\n      \n      Near-zero γ on clean benchmark是crucial specificity test——\n      ContamCal不会对uncontaminated data produce false positive calibration。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RL Observational Results Summary\"\n        columns: [Model_Family, γ_MMLU, γ_ARC, CI_Width_pp, S1_AUC, S4_AUC]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-Instruct_0.5B, 0.30, -0.18, 16.5, 0.62, 0.68]\n          - [Qwen2.5-Instruct_1.5B, 0.35, -0.25, 15.0, 0.58, 0.72]\n          - [Qwen2.5-Instruct_3B, 0.38, -0.20, 14.5, 0.65, 0.74]\n          - [Qwen2.5-Instruct_7B, 0.42, -0.28, 13.8, 0.72, 0.78]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill_1.5B, 0.28, -0.12, 18.5, 0.55, 0.70]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill_7B, 0.32, -0.15, 16.0, 0.68, 0.80]\n      - name: \"Expected Regret Comparison (Top-5 Selection)\"\n        columns: [Method, Mean_Regret_pp, Std_pp, Pct_Correct_Top1]\n        rows:\n          - [Uncalibrated, 3.8, 1.2, 0.45]\n          - [Calibrated_IRT, 2.1, 0.8, 0.65]\n          - [Remove_Rescore, 3.5, 1.1, 0.50]\n          - [Linear_Regression, 2.8, 1.0, 0.55]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"CI width comparison violin plot: SFT-controlled vs RL-observational。RL的CIs系统性更宽(1.79×)，视觉上展示honest uncertainty propagation。\"\n      - \"Expected regret bar chart with error bars: 4种方法。Calibrated IRT显著低于其他三种。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RL case study作为external validity的directional evidence。\n      不claim quantitative accuracy（CIs太宽），claim honest uncertainty\n      propagation + practical utility in model selection。\n      S4在RL models上的relative advantage是interesting finding——\n      可能是因为RL enhances model's self-evaluation capability。\n      Near-zero γ on clean benchmark closes the specificity argument。\n\n  - name: \"observational_72b\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-012\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B inference-only observational分析。\n      Extends ecological validity to frontier scale。\n    expected_results:\n      # Benchmark scores\n      mmlu_72b: 0.865\n      arc_72b: 0.945\n      gsm8k_72b: 0.910\n      humaneval_72b: 0.72\n      # Signal quality\n      S1_auc_72b: 0.975  # embedding-based remains strong\n      S2_auc_72b: 0.88   # MIA peaks at large scale\n      S4_auc_72b: 0.82   # Self-Critique strong\n      effective_signals_72b: 3\n      # IRT estimates (observational, no ground truth)\n      gamma_mmlu_72b: 0.45\n      gamma_mmlu_72b_ci: [0.08, 0.85]\n      gamma_arc_72b: -0.08\n      gamma_arc_72b_ci: [-0.52, 0.35]\n      ci_width_72b_pp: 12.0\n      # Comparison with smaller scales\n      gamma_pattern_consistent_with_smaller: true\n      mmlu_positive_arc_nearZero_gsm8k_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B is inference-only (no SFT injection, no ground truth)——\n      purely observational。Signal quality peaks at this scale：\n      S2 AUC=0.88因为72B has maximum memorization capacity，\n      MIA最sensitive。S4=0.82因为72B的Self-Critique最reliable。\n      \n      Gamma estimates direction-consistent with controlled experiments：\n      MMLU正(contamination inflation)，ARC接近零（72B不会forgetting），\n      GSM8K零。ARC gamma从0.5B的-1.65上升到72B的-0.08——\n      证实forgetting是small-model phenomenon，not general。\n      \n      没有ground truth所以不计算MAE/coverage。\n      价值是ecological validity：\"在frontier scale上gamma的direction和\n      heterogeneity pattern与controlled实验一致。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"72B Observational Results\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, Accuracy, γ_estimate, \"95% CI\", Signal_Quality_S1]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.865, 0.45, \"[0.08, 0.85]\", 0.975]\n          - [ARC, 0.945, -0.08, \"[-0.52, 0.35]\", 0.980]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.910, 0.03, \"[-0.40, 0.45]\", 0.982]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"gamma vs model scale trajectory plot: x轴log(params) 0.5B→72B, y轴gamma, 分三条线(MMLU/ARC/GSM8K)。ARC线从-1.65上升到-0.08(forgetting消失)，MMLU线稳定在0.3-0.9(inflation persistent)，GSM8K线flat at 0。\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B观测性数据provides scale extrapolation evidence。\n      γ_k pattern's consistency across 0.5B-72B strengthens\n      \"benchmark property\" argument——contamination susceptibility\n      is intrinsic to benchmark format, not model scale。\n\n  - name: \"closed_weight_2signal_mode\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-013\"\n    description: >\n      Degraded 2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique, no logits/embeddings)。\n      Closed-weight applicability ablation。\n    expected_results:\n      # 2-signal RRF AUC\n      rrf_2sig_auc_15B_d005: 0.74\n      rrf_2sig_auc_3B_d005: 0.79\n      rrf_2sig_auc_7B_d005: 0.83\n      # IRT with 2-signal exposure\n      gamma_mmlu_2sig: 0.62\n      gamma_mmlu_2sig_ci: [-0.10, 1.35]\n      gamma_arc_2sig: -1.10\n      gamma_arc_2sig_ci: [-2.45, 0.20]\n      # Calibration comparison (2-sig vs 4-sig)\n      mae_2sig_pp: 4.5\n      mae_4sig_pp: 3.2\n      mae_gap_pp: 1.3\n      coverage_95_2sig: 0.50\n      coverage_95_4sig: 0.62\n      coverage_gap_pp: 12\n      kendall_tau_2sig: 0.72\n      kendall_tau_4sig: 0.82\n    result_rationale: >\n      2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) 没有S1(embedding)和S2(logits)，\n      AUC ceiling受限于这两个signals的individual performance。\n      在best档下S3 ConStat在1.5B已恢复到0.72，S4在1.5B=0.55——\n      RRF fusion of two moderate signals yields 0.74。\n      \n      MAE gap 1.3pp是honest degradation：exposure信号质量下降导致\n      gamma estimation less precise。但γ direction仍然正确\n      (MMLU正, ARC负)——direction > magnitude for practical use。\n      \n      Coverage从62%降到50%——fisher info预测AUC从0.97(4-sig)\n      降到0.74(2-sig)时CI width增加~60%，coverage下降合理。\n      \n      Kendall τ=0.72 vs 0.82——ranking preservation受limited signal\n      影响，但仍然useful for practical model selection。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration Gap\"\n        columns: [Metric, 2-Signal, 4-Signal, Gap]\n        rows:\n          - [MAE_pp, 4.5, 3.2, 1.3]\n          - [Coverage_95, 0.50, 0.62, -0.12]\n          - [Kendall_tau, 0.72, 0.82, -0.10]\n          - [CI_Width_pp, 13.5, 8.5, +5.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2-sig vs 4-sig calibration accuracy comparison bar chart，side by side for MAE/Coverage/τ。4-sig consistently better但2-sig still useful。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Closed-weight mode是practical extension，not core contribution。\n      Gap of 1.3pp MAE and 12pp coverage is honest and expected。\n      论文positioning：framework extensible to closed-weight scenarios\n      with quantified degradation。Future work中improve S3/S4。\n\n  - name: \"multi_family_validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      Controlled SFT on non-Qwen family (Llama-3.2-1B or Pythia-1.4B)\n      at 3 dosage levels (0%, 25%, 100%)。Cross-family generalization。\n    expected_results:\n      # Baseline accuracy (Llama-3.2-1B)\n      mmlu_llama_d000: 0.42\n      arc_llama_d000: 0.52\n      gsm8k_llama_d000: 0.28\n      # Contamination effects\n      mmlu_llama_d100: 0.44  # +2pp inflation\n      arc_llama_d100: 0.40   # -12pp forgetting (catastrophic, like Qwen 0.5B)\n      gsm8k_llama_d100: 0.29 # +1pp (near zero)\n      # Gamma estimates (Llama-only fit)\n      gamma_mmlu_llama: 0.72\n      gamma_arc_llama: -2.10\n      gamma_gsm8k_llama: 0.05\n      # Cross-family gamma correlation\n      cross_family_gamma_r: 0.91\n      gamma_pattern_match: \"MMLU+/ARC−/GSM8K≈0 identical across families\"\n      # Signal quality (Llama)\n      S1_auc_llama_d005: 0.965\n      S2_auc_llama_d005: 0.58  # 1B scale, similar to Qwen 0.5B\n      # Identifiability at actual N\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_mmlu: true\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_arc: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-family validation的核心预测：γ_k heterogeneity pattern\n      (MMLU正/ARC负/GSM8K≈0) 跨family一致。这是best档的关键evidence——\n      如果pattern不一致，\"benchmark property\" argument崩塌。\n      \n      Llama-3.2-1B与Qwen2.5-0.5B comparable scale，所以：\n      (1) ARC forgetting同样catastrophic (-12pp)——这是MC contamination的\n      general property而非Qwen-specific；\n      (2) MMLU inflation moderate (+2pp)——knowledge contamination效应\n      consistent across architectures；\n      (3) GSM8K near-zero——open-ended immunity is format-dependent。\n      \n      cross-family r=0.91直接支撑paper framing的central claim。\n      Signal quality在Llama上similar pattern：S1 robust，S2 scale-limited。\n      Llama的tokenizer不同(BPE vs Qwen的byte-level BPE)但S1用的是\n      external embedding model(sentence-transformers)所以tokenizer-agnostic。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Family γ_k Comparison\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, Qwen2.5_γ, Llama3.2_γ, Direction_Match]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.85, 0.72, \"✓ Both positive\"]\n          - [ARC, -1.65, -2.10, \"✓ Both negative\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.08, 0.05, \"✓ Both ≈0\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 1.92, \"N/A\", \"Not tested\"]\n      - name: \"Llama-3.2-1B Dose-Response\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, d000, d025, d100, Δ_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.42, 0.43, 0.44, +2.0]\n          - [ARC, 0.52, 0.48, 0.40, -12.0]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.28, 0.28, 0.29, +1.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-family gamma scatter plot: Qwen γ vs Llama γ per benchmark, with r=0.91 annotation。三个点清晰地在y=x线附近(MMLU, GSM8K)或在第三象限(ARC)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-family validation是rebuttal-ready material但在best档下\n      可直接纳入main paper。r=0.91的cross-family consistency是\n      \"contamination susceptibility is a benchmark property\" claim的\n      strongest evidence。Reviewer concern #11 directly addressed。\n\n  - name: \"sft_d100_qc_only\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-015\"\n    description: >\n      100% dosage SFT using only QC-pass paraphrases (7547/16697 items)。\n      Isolates noisy vs clean contamination confound。Status: orphaned。\n    expected_results:\n      # Benchmark accuracy (QC-only d100, 0.5B)\n      mmlu_qc_d100: 0.285\n      arc_qc_d100: 0.265\n      gsm8k_qc_d100: 0.365\n      humaneval_qc_d100: 0.095\n      # Comparison with all-paraphrase d100\n      mmlu_delta_vs_all_d100: +5.2pp  # QC-only slightly better (less noisy training)\n      arc_delta_vs_all_d100: +3.8pp\n      # IRT gamma comparison\n      gamma_mmlu_qc: 0.95\n      gamma_mmlu_all: 0.85\n      gamma_delta_pp: 0.10\n      # Signal quality\n      S1_auc_qc_d100: 0.55  # lower because fewer items contaminated (7547 vs 16697)\n    result_rationale: >\n      QC-only paraphrases是higher quality contamination（BLEU<0.3, cosine>0.85）。\n      用7547 items代替16697意味着contamination coverage降低（~45%的items），\n      但每个contaminated item的quality更高。\n      \n      Benchmark accuracy比all-paraphrase d100略高(+3-5pp)因为：\n      (1) fewer noisy paraphrases = less catastrophic forgetting on ARC，\n      (2) higher quality paraphrases provide more effective knowledge retention。\n      \n      IRT gamma对QC-only略高(0.95 vs 0.85)因为signal-to-noise ratio\n      在QC-passed items上更好——contamination effect per-item更清晰。\n      \n      S1 AUC在QC d100更低(0.55)因为只有45%的items被contaminated，\n      embedding retrieval的discriminability天然降低。\n      但这不影响per-benchmark gamma estimation因为exposure是continuous。\n      \n      此实验已orphaned，但在best档下可完成作为robustness check。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"QC-only vs All-paraphrase d100 Comparison (0.5B)\"\n        columns: [Metric, QC_Only, All_Paraphrase, Delta]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU_acc, 0.285, 0.233, +5.2pp]\n          - [ARC_acc, 0.265, 0.227, +3.8pp]\n          - [GSM8K_acc, 0.365, 0.357, +0.8pp]\n          - [IRT_gamma_MMLU, 0.95, 0.85, +0.10]\n          - [S1_AUC, 0.55, 0.49, +0.06]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      QC-only是appendix-level robustness check。核心finding：\n      contamination质量影响magnitude但不影响direction——\n      gamma方向(MMLU+/ARC−/GSM8K≈0)在QC-only条件下identical。\n      这validates paraphrase quality不是confound。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9795,"cache_read_input_tokens":47334,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9795},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc5ed0-3b5c-4cd2-8f40-2efd640e4fc9","uuid":"fc4a2d3a-9809-463a-954c-4fddb11ffff4"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":567247,"duration_api_ms":554289,"num_turns":5,"result":"Now I have enough context from the existing data to ground the predictions. Let me synthesize the best-tier predictions for every planned experiment.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  D038 framing完全成立。三条claim均可保持原始强度。Lead with per-benchmark γ_k\n  异质性作为novel empirical finding（ARC负/MMLU正/GSM8K≈0），calibration improvement\n  作为practical demonstration。关键转折：N≥16 multi-seed pooling解决了N=8时的\n  convergence崩塌问题（MMLU从rhat=1.54降至<1.01），coverage从0.18-0.63升至0.50-0.75。\n  S2(Min-K++)在1.5B恢复到AUC≥0.65使RRF不再退化为S1-only，Min-K++方向反转\n  在d100条件下的cautionary finding保留。Fisher Info理论阈值AUC≥0.70与实证吻合，\n  为identifiability claim提供closed-form grounding。论文结构：§3 signal characterization\n  (C2, 最citation-worthy)，§4 IRT calibration with γ_k heterogeneity (C1)，\n  §5 Fisher Info identifiability bounds (C3)。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"stage1_signal_pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      在exp-001所有contaminated+clean模型上计算4个detection signal:\n      S1 embedding retrieval, S2 Min-K++, S3 ConStat, S4 Self-Critique。\n      0.5B已完成(exp_002_signals_05B)。此处预测1.5B和3B的完整结果。\n    expected_results:\n      # 0.5B 已有实际数据，直接引用\n      S1_embedding_auc_05B_d005: 0.975\n      S2_minkpp_auc_05B_d005: 0.465\n      S4_selfcritique_auc_05B_d005: 0.481\n      # 1.5B 预测（best档：S2恢复）\n      S1_embedding_auc_15B_d005: 0.982\n      S2_minkpp_auc_15B_d005: 0.68\n      S3_constat_auc_15B_d005: 0.72\n      S4_selfcritique_auc_15B_d005: 0.55\n      # 3B 预测（best档：S2进一步提升）\n      S1_embedding_auc_3B_d005: 0.988\n      S2_minkpp_auc_3B_d005: 0.74\n      S3_constat_auc_3B_d005: 0.78\n      S4_selfcritique_auc_3B_d005: 0.62\n      # d100 cross-model Cohen's d（方向反转保留）\n      S2_minkpp_cohens_d_05B_d100: -1.98  # 实际数据\n      S2_minkpp_cohens_d_15B_d100: -1.45\n      S2_minkpp_cohens_d_3B_d100: -0.82\n      effective_signals_05B: 1\n      effective_signals_15B: 2  # S1+S2\n      effective_signals_3B: 3  # S1+S2+S3\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档核心假设之一是S2(Min-K++)在1.5B/3B恢复到AUC≥0.65。\n      理论依据：Min-K++依赖模型对training data的memorization程度，\n      0.5B参数量不足以在SFT后产生足够的perplexity差异（capacity bottleneck），\n      但1.5B/3B有3-6×参数量，memorization capacity线性增长，\n      足以在contaminated items上产生可检测的perplexity drop。\n      0.5B已观测到S2 AUC=0.465（chance level），这与文献中\n      Carlini et al. 2022报告的\"小模型MIA near-chance\"一致。\n      1.5B跨过capacity threshold后S2恢复到0.68是合理的——\n      MIA文献（Shokri 2017）在1-3B参数量模型上报告AUC 0.6-0.8。\n      S2的Cohen's d方向反转在d100条件下随scale减弱（从-1.98到-0.82），\n      因为更大的模型对massive contamination的distributional shift更鲁棒。\n      ConStat(S3)在1.5B/3B恢复是因为paraphrase gap在较大模型上\n      更稳定（1.5B eval数据已显示MC benchmarks <1pp gap，但3B有更清晰的pattern）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Signal AUC × Scale × Dosage Matrix\"\n        columns: [Signal, Scale, d005_AUC, d025_AUC, d100_Cohen_d]\n        rows:\n          - [S1_Embedding, 0.5B, 0.975, 0.96, 3.60]\n          - [S1_Embedding, 1.5B, 0.982, 0.97, 4.16]\n          - [S1_Embedding, 3B, 0.988, 0.98, 4.50]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, 0.5B, 0.465, 0.48, -1.98]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, 1.5B, 0.68, 0.71, -1.45]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, 3B, 0.74, 0.76, -0.82]\n          - [S3_ConStat, 1.5B, 0.72, 0.74, 2.10]\n          - [S3_ConStat, 3B, 0.78, 0.80, 2.85]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 0.5B, 0.481, 0.49, 0.45]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 1.5B, 0.55, 0.58, 0.90]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 3B, 0.62, 0.65, 1.30]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Signal × Scale AUC heatmap (4 signals × 3 scales), d005条件。颜色从红(0.5)到绿(1.0)。S1全列深绿，S2从红(0.5B)渐变到黄绿(3B)，S3类似但起点更高，S4始终偏黄。右侧标注effective_signals count。\"\n    analysis: >\n      S2在1.5B/3B恢复证实scale-dependent假设成立。S1始终dominant(AUC>0.97)，\n      S2恢复后RRF不再退化为S1-only。Min-K++方向反转随scale减弱但不消失——\n      这是社区级cautionary finding：即使在3B，d100条件下Min-K++仍然misleading。\n      C2 claim可保持\"scale-dependent\"措辞。\n\n  - name: \"rrf_aggregation_ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      RRF融合4个信号为composite exposure score。含ablation:\n      RRF vs equal-weight, single-signal ×4, calibration-based weighted RRF,\n      FP injection robustness, degraded 2-signal mode。\n    expected_results:\n      rrf_4signal_auc_15B_d005: 0.985\n      rrf_4signal_auc_3B_d005: 0.990\n      rrf_3signal_auc_05B_d005: 0.970  # 已有 exp_003_rrf_05B\n      s1_only_auc_15B_d005: 0.982\n      s1_only_auc_3B_d005: 0.988\n      rrf_vs_s1only_delta_auc_15B: 0.003\n      rrf_vs_s1only_delta_auc_3B: 0.002\n      rrf_vs_equal_weight_delta_auc: 0.005\n      fp_injection_10pct_auc_drop: 0.02\n      fp_injection_20pct_auc_drop: 0.06\n      degraded_2signal_auc_15B: 0.74\n      degraded_2signal_auc_3B: 0.79\n      rrf_rank_correlation_vs_oracle: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      RRF的marginal gain over S1-only较小（+0.003 at 1.5B），因为S1已经\n      near-perfect(0.982)。RRF的价值不在于AUC提升，而在于：(1)当S1\n      偶尔失败时（某些item类型）S2/S3提供backup，(2)FP injection实验\n      显示RRF在10%FP下仅降2pp而S1-only降4pp——鲁棒性优势。\n      Equal-weight rank averaging比RRF差5pp因为给了near-chance信号\n      （S4 at 0.5B）过多权重。Degraded 2-signal mode（ConStat+SelfCritique，\n      无embeddings/logits）在1.5B达0.74是合理的——没有S1这个dominant signal，\n      两个较弱信号的融合上限受限。这为closed-weight场景提供了honest baseline。\n      meta-circularity argument成立：即使RRF≈S1-only，training-free设计\n      避免了aggregator本身被contaminated data影响的风险。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RRF Ablation Results\"\n        columns: [Method, 0.5B_AUC, 1.5B_AUC, 3B_AUC, FP_10pct_drop]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF_4signal, 0.970, 0.985, 0.990, 0.02]\n          - [S1_only, 0.975, 0.982, 0.988, 0.04]\n          - [S2_only, 0.465, 0.680, 0.740, 0.03]\n          - [S3_only, \"N/A\", 0.720, 0.780, 0.05]\n          - [S4_only, 0.481, 0.550, 0.620, 0.08]\n          - [Equal_weight, 0.820, 0.910, 0.940, 0.03]\n          - [Degraded_2sig, \"N/A\", 0.740, 0.790, 0.06]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"FP injection robustness curve: x轴FP rate (0-30%), y轴AUC retention。RRF线最平稳，S1-only次之，equal-weight和single弱信号下降最快。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF在best档下充分发挥作用——虽然marginal AUC gain小，但robustness\n      和principled aggregation的argument成立。论文positioning: RRF是design choice\n      (not contribution)，meta-circularity是justification。Degraded 2-signal\n      结果为closed-weight extension提供baseline。\n\n  - name: \"irt_calibration_and_baselines\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS) on controlled models。N≥16 multi-seed pooling。\n      Per-benchmark γ_k fitting + joint fitting ablation。7 baselines。\n      6 evaluation metrics。3 seeds mean±std。\n    expected_results:\n      # Per-benchmark gamma (N=24, 3 scales × 4 dosages × 2 seeds)\n      gamma_mmlu_mean: 0.85\n      gamma_mmlu_ci: [0.32, 1.42]\n      gamma_mmlu_excludes_zero: true\n      gamma_arc_mean: -1.65\n      gamma_arc_ci: [-2.80, -0.55]\n      gamma_arc_excludes_zero: true\n      gamma_gsm8k_mean: 0.08\n      gamma_gsm8k_ci: [-0.28, 0.42]\n      gamma_gsm8k_excludes_zero: false  # negative control\n      gamma_humaneval_mean: 1.92\n      gamma_humaneval_ci: [0.85, 3.10]\n      gamma_humaneval_excludes_zero: true\n      # MCMC diagnostics\n      rhat_max_mmlu: 1.005\n      rhat_max_arc: 1.004\n      rhat_max_gsm8k: 1.008\n      ess_min_mmlu: 650\n      ess_min_arc: 820\n      ess_min_gsm8k: 480\n      convergence_rate: 0.92  # 11/12 fits converge (3 benchmarks × 2 models × 2 seeds, GSM8K joint may wobble)\n      # Calibration metrics (contaminated conditions only, d005/d025/d100)\n      mae_irt_4pl_gamma_pp: 3.2\n      mae_raw_pp: 5.8\n      mae_improvement_over_raw_pp: 2.6\n      mae_linear_regression_pp: 4.1\n      mae_dcr_fuzzy_pp: 14.5\n      mae_vanilla_4pl_pp: 5.5\n      mae_remove_rescore_pp: 5.2\n      mae_emperor_pp: 5.6\n      mae_2pl_gamma_pp: 4.8\n      # Coverage\n      coverage_95_irt: 0.62\n      coverage_80_irt: 0.45\n      coverage_50_irt: 0.28\n      coverage_95_raw: 0.35\n      # Sharpness\n      sharpness_95_irt_pp: 8.5\n      # Ranking\n      kendall_tau_irt: 0.82\n      kendall_tau_raw: 0.68\n      kendall_tau_linear: 0.75\n      # Cross-seed gamma stability\n      gamma_cross_seed_r_arc: 0.92\n      gamma_cross_seed_r_mmlu: 0.88\n      gamma_cross_seed_r_gsm8k: 0.45  # low because near-zero, noise dominates\n      # SBC diagnostic\n      sbc_rank_uniformity_p: 0.12  # marginal, not perfect\n      sbc_coverage_gap_source: \"local_independence_violation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=8时MMLU完全崩塌(rhat=1.54, ess=7)、ARC coverage=62.5%、GSM8K coverage=31%。\n      best档假设N≥16 multi-seed pooling解决convergence——理论依据：\n      (1) sim sweep已证实N=50时coverage稳定在95%+，N=20时仍有~85%；\n      (2) 从N=8到N=24增加3×数据点，item参数估计大幅改善；\n      (3) 1.5B/3B加入pooling后theta分布更连续，解决了\"只有两个能力水平\"的问题。\n      \n      MMLU gamma=0.85正向显著：contamination确实inflate MMLU accuracy（已知pattern，\n      paraphrase gap在3B d100显示+3.5pp）。但效应不极端——MMLU是14K items，\n      contamination效应被大量clean items稀释。\n      \n      ARC gamma=-1.65负向显著：catastrophic forgetting at small scale。\n      0.5B d100 ARC accuracy暴跌17.5pp(s42)/-10.2pp(s123)是strongest evidence。\n      3B d100仅-1pp说明forgetting是scale-dependent，但pooled模型中\n      0.5B的极端forgetting驱动整体gamma为负。\n      \n      GSM8K gamma≈0是perfect negative control：open-ended tasks的\n      contamination不通过MC accuracy体现（再分配型效应，非加法型）。\n      oracle实验已显示gamma=3.77但overcorrects 21×——在best档下，\n      multi-seed pooling + 3B data可能将gamma压到接近0，\n      因为3B scale下GSM8K的contamination effect确实near-zero。\n      \n      MAE improvement 2.6pp over raw是在contaminated conditions(d005/d025/d100)\n      上取均值。ARC和MMLU各贡献~1-3pp improvement（因为gamma显著且校正方向正确），\n      GSM8K近零（gamma≈0不校正，MAE≈raw），HumanEval贡献最多但item数少。\n      \n      Coverage 62%虽远低于95%名义值，但比N=8时的18-33%有实质改善。\n      SBC诊断将gap归因于local independence violation——\n      单模型产生所有item response违反IRT基本假设，\n      这是结构性limitation而非N不足，在Limitations中充分讨论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Per-benchmark γ_k Estimates (N=24, Multi-seed Pooled)\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, γ_mean, \"95% CI\", Excludes_Zero, Direction, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.85, \"[0.32, 1.42]\", \"Yes\", Positive, \"Contamination inflates MC accuracy\"]\n          - [ARC-Challenge, -1.65, \"[-2.80, -0.55]\", \"Yes\", Negative, \"Catastrophic forgetting at small scale\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.08, \"[-0.28, 0.42]\", \"No\", \"≈Zero\", \"Negative control: no MC inflation\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 1.92, \"[0.85, 3.10]\", \"Yes\", Positive, \"Strong inflation on code generation\"]\n      - name: \"Calibration Error Comparison (MAE, pp) — Contaminated Conditions\"\n        columns: [Method, MMLU, ARC, GSM8K, HumanEval, Mean]\n        rows:\n          - [IRT_4PL_gamma, 2.8, 3.5, 0.8, 5.7, 3.2]\n          - [B0_Raw, 4.2, 8.8, 0.5, 9.5, 5.8]\n          - [B1_Remove_Rescore, 3.9, 7.5, 0.6, 8.8, 5.2]\n          - [B2_2PL_gamma, 3.8, 5.2, 1.2, 9.0, 4.8]\n          - [B3_Vanilla_4PL, 4.0, 7.8, 0.6, 9.5, 5.5]\n          - [B4_Linear_Reg, 3.2, 4.8, 0.5, 7.8, 4.1]\n          - [B5_Emperor, 4.1, 8.5, 0.5, 9.2, 5.6]\n          - [B6_DCR_Fuzzy, 12.0, 15.5, 8.2, 22.0, 14.5]\n      - name: \"Coverage and Ranking Metrics\"\n        columns: [Method, C95, C80, C50, Sharpness_95_pp, Kendall_tau]\n        rows:\n          - [IRT_4PL_gamma, 0.62, 0.45, 0.28, 8.5, 0.82]\n          - [B0_Raw, 0.35, 0.25, 0.15, \"N/A\", 0.68]\n          - [B4_Linear_Reg, 0.55, 0.40, 0.22, 12.0, 0.75]\n          - [B6_DCR_Fuzzy, 0.20, 0.15, 0.08, 25.0, 0.45]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Calibrated-vs-true accuracy scatter plot with 95% CI bars。每个点是一个model×benchmark组合。IRT点密集分布在y=x线附近，raw baseline系统性偏离。ARC的负校正（向上校正forgetting）和MMLU的正校正（向下校正inflation）方向清晰可见。\"\n      - \"Dose-response monotonicity curve：x轴dosage(0/5/25/100%)，y轴|gamma_effect|。MMLU和ARC呈单调递增，GSM8K平坦在0附近。\"\n      - \"Per-benchmark gamma forest plot：4个benchmark的gamma estimate + 95% CI并排展示，零线标注。ARC在左(负)，GSM8K跨零，MMLU和HumanEval在右(正)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C1 calibration claim在best档下fully supported：IRT在γ显著的benchmark\n      (ARC/MMLU/HumanEval)上MAE improvement 1.4-3.8pp over raw。GSM8K作为\n      negative control被正确识别为不需要校准（gamma≈0）。Coverage 62%虽不达\n      名义95%，但比raw(35%)和DCR(20%)显著改善。Kendall τ=0.82说明ranking\n      preservation良好。γ_k异质性pattern跨seed稳定(r≥0.85 for ARC/MMLU)，\n      支撑\"contamination susceptibility is a benchmark property\"的novel finding。\n      Joint model with shared global γ作为ablation会显示γ≈0（被ARC负和MMLU正抵消），\n      进一步证明per-benchmark fitting的必要性。\n\n  - name: \"simulation_identifiability_sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      144条件systematic sweep (AUC × N_models × prior × exposure_type)。\n      v5当前RUNNING。Fisher Info理论阈值与实证对比。\n    expected_results:\n      # γ recovery across key conditions\n      gamma_rmse_auc055_n20: 0.18\n      gamma_rmse_auc055_n50: 0.11\n      gamma_rmse_auc055_n100: 0.04\n      gamma_rmse_auc070_n20: 0.12\n      gamma_rmse_auc070_n50: 0.06\n      gamma_rmse_auc070_n100: 0.025\n      gamma_rmse_auc080_n50: 0.03\n      gamma_rmse_auc090_n100: 0.015\n      # Coverage\n      coverage_95_auc055_n20: 0.78\n      coverage_95_auc055_n50: 0.88\n      coverage_95_auc070_n20: 0.85\n      coverage_95_auc070_n50: 0.93\n      coverage_95_auc070_n100: 0.96\n      coverage_95_auc080_n50: 0.95\n      coverage_95_auc090_n100: 0.97\n      # CI width scaling\n      ci_width_n20_auc070_pp: 12.5\n      ci_width_n50_auc070_pp: 7.8\n      ci_width_n100_auc070_pp: 5.5\n      ci_width_n200_auc070_pp: 3.9\n      ci_width_ratio_n50_n100: 1.42  # close to sqrt(2)=1.41\n      # Fisher Info thresholds\n      fisher_structural_identifiability_auc: 0.55\n      fisher_practical_identifiability_auc: 0.70\n      fisher_reliable_estimation_auc: 0.80\n      fisher_theory_empirical_concordance: 0.93  # correlation between predicted and observed RMSE\n      # Prior sensitivity\n      prior_sensitivity_ratio_weak_strong: 1.35  # N(0,2) vs N(0,0.5) at N=50\n      prior_sensitivity_at_n200: 1.05  # negligible at large N\n      # theta correlation\n      theta_corr_auc070_n50: 0.955\n      theta_corr_auc080_n100: 0.975\n      # Growing Pains pre-estimation\n      gp_preest_coverage_improvement_n20: 0.08  # +8pp coverage vs flat prior\n      # Convergence\n      divergent_rate_overall: 0.02\n      max_rhat_95th_percentile: 1.008\n      runs_completed: 120\n      runs_total: 120\n    result_rationale: >\n      v1-v4均failed（实现bug、超时、配置错误），但v2的48/120已完成runs\n      提供了ground truth：AUC=0.55/N=100条件下bias=0.006, RMSE=0.03, coverage=100%。\n      v5在best档下全部120 runs完成。\n      \n      Fisher Info理论推导：I(γ) ∝ N_models × Σ_items [exposure_variance × \n      item_discrimination² × f(theta)]。当AUC=0.55时exposure variance极小\n      （signal barely above chance），I(γ)接近singular——结构可识别但实际\n      estimation unreliable（RMSE=0.18 at N=20）。AUC=0.70是拐点：\n      exposure variance足够大使得I(γ)的95% CI width降到可用范围(<15pp at N=50)。\n      这与实证完全吻合——AUC 0.55→0.70从RMSE 0.11→0.06 at N=50。\n      \n      CI width follows 1/√N scaling（v2已观测ratio=2.04 vs theory=2.24，\n      偏差来自non-Gaussian posterior at small N）。在best档下N=200条件\n      补充后full scaling curve可做。Prior sensitivity在N≥100后negligible(ratio 1.05)，\n      说明data dominates prior——但N=20时仍有35% sensitivity，\n      Growing Pains pre-estimation可弥补8pp coverage。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Identifiability Phase Diagram: γ RMSE\"\n        columns: [AUC, N=20, N=50, N=100, N=200]\n        rows:\n          - [0.55, 0.18, 0.11, 0.04, 0.025]\n          - [0.60, 0.15, 0.09, 0.035, 0.020]\n          - [0.65, 0.13, 0.07, 0.030, 0.018]\n          - [0.70, 0.12, 0.06, 0.025, 0.015]\n          - [0.80, 0.08, 0.03, 0.015, 0.010]\n          - [0.90, 0.05, 0.02, 0.010, 0.007]\n      - name: \"95% Coverage across Conditions\"\n        columns: [AUC, N=20, N=50, N=100, N=200]\n        rows:\n          - [0.55, 0.78, 0.88, 0.95, 0.97]\n          - [0.70, 0.85, 0.93, 0.96, 0.98]\n          - [0.80, 0.90, 0.95, 0.97, 0.98]\n          - [0.90, 0.92, 0.96, 0.97, 0.98]\n      - name: \"Fisher Info Theory vs Empirical\"\n        columns: [AUC, Predicted_RMSE_N50, Observed_RMSE_N50, Ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [0.55, 0.12, 0.11, 0.92]\n          - [0.70, 0.065, 0.06, 0.92]\n          - [0.80, 0.032, 0.03, 0.94]\n          - [0.90, 0.018, 0.02, 1.11]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Identifiability phase diagram heatmap: x轴N_models(20-200), y轴AUC(0.55-0.90), 颜色=γ RMSE。左下角深红(不可靠), 右上角深蓝(精确)。虚线标注structural(AUC=0.55)和practical(AUC=0.70)阈值。Fisher Info理论等高线叠加，与实证heatmap高度吻合。\"\n      - \"CI width vs 1/√N scaling plot: log-log坐标，实测点与理论√N线对比。AUC=0.70和0.80两条线几乎平行于理论线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C3 identifiability claim在best档下fully grounded。Fisher Info推导\n      提供了closed-form relationship: AUC≥0.55 structural, ≥0.70 practical,\n      ≥0.80 reliable。理论与实证concordance r=0.93。\n      这是论文最强的理论贡献——reviewer concern #1直接回答。\n      Coverage在N=24(实际pooled size)和AUC=0.97(S1 actual)条件下\n      理论预测~96%，实测62%的gap可归因于local independence violation\n      （simulation用independent examinees，实际是single model）。\n\n  - name: \"noise_propagation_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      Measurement error model + post-hoc noise injection。v4已完成（negative result：\n      CI对sigma_e不敏感）。best档下ME model在real data上有不同表现。\n    expected_results:\n      # Analytic ME model (simulation, confirmed negative from v4)\n      me_ci_width_range_sim: \"0.0997-0.1000\"\n      me_ci_sigma_e_monotonicity_rho_sim: 0.4\n      me_ci_sigma_e_monotonicity_p_sim: 0.50\n      # ME model on real data (best档：real exposure noise structure matters)\n      me_coverage_improvement_real_data_pp: 5\n      me_coverage_95_real: 0.67\n      me_vs_simple_coverage_95: 0.62\n      # Post-hoc noise injection\n      noise_1x_gamma_ci_widening_pct: 8\n      noise_1p5x_gamma_ci_widening_pct: 15\n      noise_2x_gamma_ci_widening_pct: 28\n      noise_2x_gamma_still_significant: true\n      noise_2x_coverage_change_pp: 3\n    result_rationale: >\n      v4已明确：analytic ME model在simulation中CI对sigma_e不敏感（rho=0.4, p=0.50）。\n      这是因为在simulation中exposure noise是symmetric Gaussian——\n      ME model的latent τ可以完美absorb这种noise without widening CI。\n      \n      best档预测：在real data上ME model有marginal improvement(+5pp coverage)，\n      因为real exposure noise不是symmetric——S2/S4在0.5B near-chance\n      产生的noise是truncated/skewed的，ME model的latent τ可以\n      partial correct for这种asymmetric noise pattern。\n      但improvement modest——ME作为ablation报告而非primary model。\n      \n      Post-hoc noise injection在2×matched noise下gamma CI宽28%\n      但仍然significant（对ARC/MMLU），证明IRT对moderate signal noise robust。\n      这支撑C3的uncertainty propagation narrative：models with degraded signals\n      appropriately get wider CIs。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Noise Injection Effect on γ Estimation\"\n        columns: [Noise_Level, γ_CI_Width_pp, γ_Still_Significant, Coverage_95]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0× (baseline)\", 2.1, \"Yes (ARC/MMLU)\", 0.62]\n          - [\"1× matched\", 2.3, \"Yes\", 0.63]\n          - [\"1.5× matched\", 2.4, \"Yes\", 0.64]\n          - [\"2× matched\", 2.7, \"Yes (marginal for MMLU)\", 0.65]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"CI width vs noise level line plot: 平坦线说明IRT对moderate noise robust。标注'practical operating range'在1-1.5×区间。\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-005核心结论：ME model是marginal improvement，不是primary贡献。\n      论文中report为ablation (\"ME model improves coverage by ~5pp\")，\n      primary model用simple exposure without ME。Post-hoc noise injection\n      证明robustness，支撑C3 uncertainty propagation narrative。\n      v4的negative result（CI不敏感）本身是有价值的finding——\n      说明IRT框架inherently robust to moderate signal noise。\n\n  - name: \"signal_survival_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      Signal × scale × dosage AUC heatmap。4 signals × {base, SFT-clean,\n      SFT-contaminated}。0.5B v4已完成。扩展到1.5B/3B + Instruct proxy。\n    expected_results:\n      # 0.5B (actual data from v4)\n      S1_d005_auc_05B_mmlu: 0.953\n      S1_d005_auc_05B_gsm8k: 0.988\n      S1_d005_auc_05B_arc: 0.995\n      S2_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.465\n      S4_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.481\n      S1_d100_cohens_d_05B_mean: 3.60\n      S2_d100_cohens_d_05B_mean: -1.98\n      # 1.5B (best档预测)\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.965\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.991\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.996\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.70\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.66\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.72\n      S4_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.56\n      S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: -1.40\n      # 3B (best档预测)\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.972\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.993\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.997\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.76\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.72\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.78\n      S4_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.63\n      S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: -0.85\n      # Instruct proxy (RL observational)\n      S1_instruct_vs_base_cohens_d_05B: 0.35\n      S4_instruct_vs_base_cohens_d_05B: 0.82\n      # Summary\n      effective_signals_05B: 1\n      effective_signals_15B: 2\n      effective_signals_3B: 3\n      min_kpp_reversal_universal: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      0.5B v4数据已确认：S1 dominant(AUC>0.95), S2/S4 near-chance。\n      best档核心假设：1.5B/3B S2恢复。\n      \n      S2(Min-K++)恢复的机制：Min-K++计算token-level surprise，\n      contaminated items的tokens应该有lower surprise（model记住了）。\n      0.5B因为capacity不足，SFT后的perplexity landscape对所有items\n      都有类似shift，discriminability丧失。1.5B/3B有足够capacity\n      selective memorize contaminated items而不disturb全局perplexity pattern。\n      \n      S2方向反转(negative Cohen's d)在d100条件下跨scale持续存在但减弱：\n      d100 = 100% items contaminated → 所有items的perplexity都降低 →\n      Min-K++的ranking反转（contaminated items的K-min tokens反而更高\n      因为model对所有tokens都familiar）。更大模型capacity足以\n      maintain部分discrimination所以d减弱，但反转direction不变。\n      \n      S4(Self-Critique)在3B达0.63——仍低于0.65 threshold但接近。\n      S4依赖model生成和评估paraphrase的能力，3B的生成质量\n      接近但不完全满足self-critique需求。\n      \n      Instruct proxy数据：S4对RL-trained models有differential signal\n      (Cohen's d=0.82)因为Instruct models的self-critique能力\n      本身就更强，提供了detection的indirect channel。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Signal Survival Heatmap — Within-model AUC at d005\"\n        columns: [Signal, 0.5B_MMLU, 0.5B_ARC, 1.5B_MMLU, 1.5B_ARC, 3B_MMLU, 3B_ARC]\n        rows:\n          - [S1_Embedding, 0.953, 0.995, 0.965, 0.996, 0.972, 0.997]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, 0.465, 0.466, 0.700, 0.720, 0.760, 0.780]\n          - [S3_ConStat, \"N/A\", \"N/A\", 0.720, 0.740, 0.780, 0.800]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 0.517, 0.433, 0.560, 0.570, 0.640, 0.650]\n      - name: \"Cross-model Cohen's d at d100 (direction reversal)\"\n        columns: [Signal, 0.5B, 1.5B, 3B, Direction]\n        rows:\n          - [S1_Embedding, 3.60, 4.16, 4.50, Positive]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, -1.98, -1.40, -0.85, \"Negative (REVERSAL)\"]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 0.45, 0.90, 1.30, Positive]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paper Figure 2: Signal × Scale AUC heatmap。6列(3 scales × 2 benchmarks), 4行(signals)。颜色编码：dark green ≥0.90, yellow-green 0.65-0.90, orange 0.55-0.65, red <0.55。S1行全绿，S2从红渐变到黄绿（scale-dependent recovery清晰可见），S4从红到橙。右侧标注effective_signals count per scale。\"\n      - \"Min-K++ direction reversal scatter: d100 Cohen's d vs model scale, 三个点连线showing reversal magnitude decreasing with scale。Annotation解释reversal mechanism。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C2 signal characterization是论文most citation-worthy finding。\n      三个层次的novelty：(1) scale-dependent signal effectiveness——\n      S2从chance(0.5B)到useful(3B)的recovery curve是community新发现；\n      (2) Min-K++ reversal——方向反转而非仅仅fail，这是强cautionary finding；\n      (3) item-level vs model-level detection distinction（within-model AUC vs\n      cross-model Cohen's d）是方法论贡献。\n\n  - name: \"scale_bridging_7b\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 5 dosage levels。\n      验证calibration accuracy scales to larger models。\n    expected_results:\n      # Benchmark accuracy (d000 baseline)\n      mmlu_7b_d000: 0.735\n      gsm8k_7b_d000: 0.795\n      arc_7b_d000: 0.885\n      humaneval_7b_d000: 0.35\n      # Contamination effects\n      mmlu_7b_d100: 0.752  # +1.7pp inflation (moderate)\n      arc_7b_d100: 0.870  # -1.5pp (mild forgetting, much less than 0.5B)\n      gsm8k_7b_d100: 0.798 # +0.3pp (near zero, negative control holds)\n      humaneval_7b_d100: 0.52 # +17pp (strong dose-response preserved)\n      # Gamma estimates (per-benchmark, pooled with 0.5B/1.5B/3B)\n      gamma_mmlu_7b_pooled: 0.92\n      gamma_arc_7b_pooled: -1.20  # less negative than without 7B (7B has mild forgetting)\n      gamma_gsm8k_7b_pooled: 0.05\n      # Signal quality at 7B\n      S1_auc_7b_d005: 0.990\n      S2_auc_7b_d005: 0.82\n      S4_auc_7b_d005: 0.71\n      effective_signals_7b: 3\n      # Calibration with 7B included (N=32 total)\n      mae_with_7b_pp: 2.8\n      coverage_95_with_7b: 0.68\n      kendall_tau_with_7b: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      7B是capacity sweet spot：足够大使得S2/S4全部恢复(AUC>0.7)，\n      但SFT contamination effect依然measurable。\n      \n      MMLU inflation仅+1.7pp（vs 3B的+0.8pp）：随scale增大，\n      base knowledge足以回答MMLU大部分questions，contamination的\n      marginal gain递减。ARC forgetting从0.5B的-17.5pp大幅缩减到\n      -1.5pp——7B的reasoning capacity不会因为SFT on MC items而崩塌。\n      \n      将7B纳入pooling将total N推到~32（4 scales × 4 dosages × 2 seeds），\n      进一步改善convergence。Coverage从62%(N=24)升到68%(N=32)——\n      consistent with sim sweep的N scaling curve。\n      \n      S2 AUC=0.82 at 7B是重要验证：MIA effectiveness确实\n      monotonically increase with model scale，支撑\"scale-dependent\"叙事。\n      3个effective signals使RRF真正发挥multi-signal fusion价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"7B Dose-Response Profile\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, d000, d005, d025, d100, \"Δ(d100-d000)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.735, 0.737, 0.742, 0.752, +1.7pp]\n          - [ARC, 0.885, 0.883, 0.878, 0.870, -1.5pp]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.795, 0.796, 0.797, 0.798, +0.3pp]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.350, 0.375, 0.420, 0.520, +17.0pp]\n      - name: \"Signal Quality at 7B Scale\"\n        columns: [Signal, d005_AUC, d100_Cohen_d, Effective]\n        rows:\n          - [S1_Embedding, 0.990, 5.10, \"Yes\"]\n          - [S2_MinKPP, 0.820, -0.50, \"Yes (reversed at d100)\"]\n          - [S3_ConStat, 0.850, 3.40, \"Yes\"]\n          - [S4_SelfCritique, 0.710, 1.65, \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scale-dependent ARC forgetting bar chart: x轴model scale(0.5B/1.5B/3B/7B), y轴Δaccuracy at d100。从-17.5pp到-1.5pp的dramatic recovery curve。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B数据strengthen all three claims。C1: coverage+3pp, MAE-0.4pp。\n      C2: effective_signals=3 at 7B validates scale-dependent hypothesis across\n      full scale range。C3: Fisher Info predicts AUC=0.82 yields RMSE≈0.02——\n      7B实际RMSE应接近。Addresses reviewer concern #4 directly。\n\n  - name: \"rl_observational_case_study\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      Apply signals to RL-trained models (Instruct variants + DeepSeek-R1-Distill)。\n      Expected regret quantification。Near-zero γ check on clean benchmark。\n    expected_results:\n      # Signal application to Instruct models\n      S1_auc_instruct_05B: 0.62  # degraded vs SFT (RL changes embedding space)\n      S1_auc_instruct_15B: 0.58\n      S1_auc_instruct_3B: 0.65\n      S1_auc_instruct_7B: 0.72\n      S4_auc_instruct_05B: 0.68  # Self-Critique relatively robust to RL\n      S4_auc_instruct_3B: 0.74\n      S4_auc_instruct_7B: 0.78\n      # IRT fitting on RL models\n      gamma_instruct_mmlu: 0.35\n      gamma_instruct_mmlu_ci: [-0.15, 0.88]\n      gamma_instruct_arc: -0.22\n      gamma_instruct_arc_ci: [-0.75, 0.30]\n      gamma_instruct_gsm8k: 0.12\n      gamma_instruct_gsm8k_ci: [-0.35, 0.60]\n      # CI widths (appropriately wider)\n      ci_width_instruct_pp: 15.2\n      ci_width_sft_controlled_pp: 8.5\n      ci_width_ratio_instruct_vs_sft: 1.79\n      # Expected regret (top-5 model selection)\n      regret_uncalibrated_top5: 3.8\n      regret_calibrated_top5: 2.1\n      regret_remove_rescore_top5: 3.5\n      regret_reduction_pct: 45\n      # Near-zero γ check (specificity)\n      gamma_clean_benchmark_mean: 0.04\n      gamma_clean_benchmark_ci_includes_zero: true\n      # DeepSeek-R1-Distill\n      deepseek_r1_gamma_mmlu: 0.28\n      deepseek_r1_ci_width_pp: 18.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      RL observational case study的核心challenge：RL changes embedding space，\n      degrading S1(embedding-based)从SFT的0.97+降到0.58-0.72。\n      但S4(Self-Critique)在RL models上反而更effective——\n      RL-trained models有更好的instruction following，\n      Self-Critique prompting更reliably执行。\n      \n      best档下gamma estimates对Instruct models偏小且CI宽：\n      (1) Instruct models的contamination来自pre-training，不是controlled injection，\n      所以exposure unknown且noisy；(2) RL training可能已经partially wash out\n      pre-training contamination effects。CI宽1.79×是appropriate——\n      honest uncertainty propagation，不是failure。\n      \n      Expected regret reduction 45%是significant practical result：\n      在top-5 model selection task中，calibrated ranking避免了\n      选择contamination-inflated models。即使individual CIs宽，\n      relative ranking仍然informative。\n      \n      Near-zero γ on clean benchmark是crucial specificity test——\n      ContamCal不会对uncontaminated data produce false positive calibration。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RL Observational Results Summary\"\n        columns: [Model_Family, γ_MMLU, γ_ARC, CI_Width_pp, S1_AUC, S4_AUC]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-Instruct_0.5B, 0.30, -0.18, 16.5, 0.62, 0.68]\n          - [Qwen2.5-Instruct_1.5B, 0.35, -0.25, 15.0, 0.58, 0.72]\n          - [Qwen2.5-Instruct_3B, 0.38, -0.20, 14.5, 0.65, 0.74]\n          - [Qwen2.5-Instruct_7B, 0.42, -0.28, 13.8, 0.72, 0.78]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill_1.5B, 0.28, -0.12, 18.5, 0.55, 0.70]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill_7B, 0.32, -0.15, 16.0, 0.68, 0.80]\n      - name: \"Expected Regret Comparison (Top-5 Selection)\"\n        columns: [Method, Mean_Regret_pp, Std_pp, Pct_Correct_Top1]\n        rows:\n          - [Uncalibrated, 3.8, 1.2, 0.45]\n          - [Calibrated_IRT, 2.1, 0.8, 0.65]\n          - [Remove_Rescore, 3.5, 1.1, 0.50]\n          - [Linear_Regression, 2.8, 1.0, 0.55]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"CI width comparison violin plot: SFT-controlled vs RL-observational。RL的CIs系统性更宽(1.79×)，视觉上展示honest uncertainty propagation。\"\n      - \"Expected regret bar chart with error bars: 4种方法。Calibrated IRT显著低于其他三种。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RL case study作为external validity的directional evidence。\n      不claim quantitative accuracy（CIs太宽），claim honest uncertainty\n      propagation + practical utility in model selection。\n      S4在RL models上的relative advantage是interesting finding——\n      可能是因为RL enhances model's self-evaluation capability。\n      Near-zero γ on clean benchmark closes the specificity argument。\n\n  - name: \"observational_72b\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-012\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B inference-only observational分析。\n      Extends ecological validity to frontier scale。\n    expected_results:\n      # Benchmark scores\n      mmlu_72b: 0.865\n      arc_72b: 0.945\n      gsm8k_72b: 0.910\n      humaneval_72b: 0.72\n      # Signal quality\n      S1_auc_72b: 0.975  # embedding-based remains strong\n      S2_auc_72b: 0.88   # MIA peaks at large scale\n      S4_auc_72b: 0.82   # Self-Critique strong\n      effective_signals_72b: 3\n      # IRT estimates (observational, no ground truth)\n      gamma_mmlu_72b: 0.45\n      gamma_mmlu_72b_ci: [0.08, 0.85]\n      gamma_arc_72b: -0.08\n      gamma_arc_72b_ci: [-0.52, 0.35]\n      ci_width_72b_pp: 12.0\n      # Comparison with smaller scales\n      gamma_pattern_consistent_with_smaller: true\n      mmlu_positive_arc_nearZero_gsm8k_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B is inference-only (no SFT injection, no ground truth)——\n      purely observational。Signal quality peaks at this scale：\n      S2 AUC=0.88因为72B has maximum memorization capacity，\n      MIA最sensitive。S4=0.82因为72B的Self-Critique最reliable。\n      \n      Gamma estimates direction-consistent with controlled experiments：\n      MMLU正(contamination inflation)，ARC接近零（72B不会forgetting），\n      GSM8K零。ARC gamma从0.5B的-1.65上升到72B的-0.08——\n      证实forgetting是small-model phenomenon，not general。\n      \n      没有ground truth所以不计算MAE/coverage。\n      价值是ecological validity：\"在frontier scale上gamma的direction和\n      heterogeneity pattern与controlled实验一致。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"72B Observational Results\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, Accuracy, γ_estimate, \"95% CI\", Signal_Quality_S1]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.865, 0.45, \"[0.08, 0.85]\", 0.975]\n          - [ARC, 0.945, -0.08, \"[-0.52, 0.35]\", 0.980]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.910, 0.03, \"[-0.40, 0.45]\", 0.982]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"gamma vs model scale trajectory plot: x轴log(params) 0.5B→72B, y轴gamma, 分三条线(MMLU/ARC/GSM8K)。ARC线从-1.65上升到-0.08(forgetting消失)，MMLU线稳定在0.3-0.9(inflation persistent)，GSM8K线flat at 0。\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B观测性数据provides scale extrapolation evidence。\n      γ_k pattern's consistency across 0.5B-72B strengthens\n      \"benchmark property\" argument——contamination susceptibility\n      is intrinsic to benchmark format, not model scale。\n\n  - name: \"closed_weight_2signal_mode\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-013\"\n    description: >\n      Degraded 2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique, no logits/embeddings)。\n      Closed-weight applicability ablation。\n    expected_results:\n      # 2-signal RRF AUC\n      rrf_2sig_auc_15B_d005: 0.74\n      rrf_2sig_auc_3B_d005: 0.79\n      rrf_2sig_auc_7B_d005: 0.83\n      # IRT with 2-signal exposure\n      gamma_mmlu_2sig: 0.62\n      gamma_mmlu_2sig_ci: [-0.10, 1.35]\n      gamma_arc_2sig: -1.10\n      gamma_arc_2sig_ci: [-2.45, 0.20]\n      # Calibration comparison (2-sig vs 4-sig)\n      mae_2sig_pp: 4.5\n      mae_4sig_pp: 3.2\n      mae_gap_pp: 1.3\n      coverage_95_2sig: 0.50\n      coverage_95_4sig: 0.62\n      coverage_gap_pp: 12\n      kendall_tau_2sig: 0.72\n      kendall_tau_4sig: 0.82\n    result_rationale: >\n      2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) 没有S1(embedding)和S2(logits)，\n      AUC ceiling受限于这两个signals的individual performance。\n      在best档下S3 ConStat在1.5B已恢复到0.72，S4在1.5B=0.55——\n      RRF fusion of two moderate signals yields 0.74。\n      \n      MAE gap 1.3pp是honest degradation：exposure信号质量下降导致\n      gamma estimation less precise。但γ direction仍然正确\n      (MMLU正, ARC负)——direction > magnitude for practical use。\n      \n      Coverage从62%降到50%——fisher info预测AUC从0.97(4-sig)\n      降到0.74(2-sig)时CI width增加~60%，coverage下降合理。\n      \n      Kendall τ=0.72 vs 0.82——ranking preservation受limited signal\n      影响，但仍然useful for practical model selection。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration Gap\"\n        columns: [Metric, 2-Signal, 4-Signal, Gap]\n        rows:\n          - [MAE_pp, 4.5, 3.2, 1.3]\n          - [Coverage_95, 0.50, 0.62, -0.12]\n          - [Kendall_tau, 0.72, 0.82, -0.10]\n          - [CI_Width_pp, 13.5, 8.5, +5.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2-sig vs 4-sig calibration accuracy comparison bar chart，side by side for MAE/Coverage/τ。4-sig consistently better但2-sig still useful。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Closed-weight mode是practical extension，not core contribution。\n      Gap of 1.3pp MAE and 12pp coverage is honest and expected。\n      论文positioning：framework extensible to closed-weight scenarios\n      with quantified degradation。Future work中improve S3/S4。\n\n  - name: \"multi_family_validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      Controlled SFT on non-Qwen family (Llama-3.2-1B or Pythia-1.4B)\n      at 3 dosage levels (0%, 25%, 100%)。Cross-family generalization。\n    expected_results:\n      # Baseline accuracy (Llama-3.2-1B)\n      mmlu_llama_d000: 0.42\n      arc_llama_d000: 0.52\n      gsm8k_llama_d000: 0.28\n      # Contamination effects\n      mmlu_llama_d100: 0.44  # +2pp inflation\n      arc_llama_d100: 0.40   # -12pp forgetting (catastrophic, like Qwen 0.5B)\n      gsm8k_llama_d100: 0.29 # +1pp (near zero)\n      # Gamma estimates (Llama-only fit)\n      gamma_mmlu_llama: 0.72\n      gamma_arc_llama: -2.10\n      gamma_gsm8k_llama: 0.05\n      # Cross-family gamma correlation\n      cross_family_gamma_r: 0.91\n      gamma_pattern_match: \"MMLU+/ARC−/GSM8K≈0 identical across families\"\n      # Signal quality (Llama)\n      S1_auc_llama_d005: 0.965\n      S2_auc_llama_d005: 0.58  # 1B scale, similar to Qwen 0.5B\n      # Identifiability at actual N\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_mmlu: true\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_arc: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-family validation的核心预测：γ_k heterogeneity pattern\n      (MMLU正/ARC负/GSM8K≈0) 跨family一致。这是best档的关键evidence——\n      如果pattern不一致，\"benchmark property\" argument崩塌。\n      \n      Llama-3.2-1B与Qwen2.5-0.5B comparable scale，所以：\n      (1) ARC forgetting同样catastrophic (-12pp)——这是MC contamination的\n      general property而非Qwen-specific；\n      (2) MMLU inflation moderate (+2pp)——knowledge contamination效应\n      consistent across architectures；\n      (3) GSM8K near-zero——open-ended immunity is format-dependent。\n      \n      cross-family r=0.91直接支撑paper framing的central claim。\n      Signal quality在Llama上similar pattern：S1 robust，S2 scale-limited。\n      Llama的tokenizer不同(BPE vs Qwen的byte-level BPE)但S1用的是\n      external embedding model(sentence-transformers)所以tokenizer-agnostic。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Family γ_k Comparison\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, Qwen2.5_γ, Llama3.2_γ, Direction_Match]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.85, 0.72, \"✓ Both positive\"]\n          - [ARC, -1.65, -2.10, \"✓ Both negative\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.08, 0.05, \"✓ Both ≈0\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 1.92, \"N/A\", \"Not tested\"]\n      - name: \"Llama-3.2-1B Dose-Response\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, d000, d025, d100, Δ_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.42, 0.43, 0.44, +2.0]\n          - [ARC, 0.52, 0.48, 0.40, -12.0]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.28, 0.28, 0.29, +1.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-family gamma scatter plot: Qwen γ vs Llama γ per benchmark, with r=0.91 annotation。三个点清晰地在y=x线附近(MMLU, GSM8K)或在第三象限(ARC)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-family validation是rebuttal-ready material但在best档下\n      可直接纳入main paper。r=0.91的cross-family consistency是\n      \"contamination susceptibility is a benchmark property\" claim的\n      strongest evidence。Reviewer concern #11 directly addressed。\n\n  - name: \"sft_d100_qc_only\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-015\"\n    description: >\n      100% dosage SFT using only QC-pass paraphrases (7547/16697 items)。\n      Isolates noisy vs clean contamination confound。Status: orphaned。\n    expected_results:\n      # Benchmark accuracy (QC-only d100, 0.5B)\n      mmlu_qc_d100: 0.285\n      arc_qc_d100: 0.265\n      gsm8k_qc_d100: 0.365\n      humaneval_qc_d100: 0.095\n      # Comparison with all-paraphrase d100\n      mmlu_delta_vs_all_d100: +5.2pp  # QC-only slightly better (less noisy training)\n      arc_delta_vs_all_d100: +3.8pp\n      # IRT gamma comparison\n      gamma_mmlu_qc: 0.95\n      gamma_mmlu_all: 0.85\n      gamma_delta_pp: 0.10\n      # Signal quality\n      S1_auc_qc_d100: 0.55  # lower because fewer items contaminated (7547 vs 16697)\n    result_rationale: >\n      QC-only paraphrases是higher quality contamination（BLEU<0.3, cosine>0.85）。\n      用7547 items代替16697意味着contamination coverage降低（~45%的items），\n      但每个contaminated item的quality更高。\n      \n      Benchmark accuracy比all-paraphrase d100略高(+3-5pp)因为：\n      (1) fewer noisy paraphrases = less catastrophic forgetting on ARC，\n      (2) higher quality paraphrases provide more effective knowledge retention。\n      \n      IRT gamma对QC-only略高(0.95 vs 0.85)因为signal-to-noise ratio\n      在QC-passed items上更好——contamination effect per-item更清晰。\n      \n      S1 AUC在QC d100更低(0.55)因为只有45%的items被contaminated，\n      embedding retrieval的discriminability天然降低。\n      但这不影响per-benchmark gamma estimation因为exposure是continuous。\n      \n      此实验已orphaned，但在best档下可完成作为robustness check。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"QC-only vs All-paraphrase d100 Comparison (0.5B)\"\n        columns: [Metric, QC_Only, All_Paraphrase, Delta]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU_acc, 0.285, 0.233, +5.2pp]\n          - [ARC_acc, 0.265, 0.227, +3.8pp]\n          - [GSM8K_acc, 0.365, 0.357, +0.8pp]\n          - [IRT_gamma_MMLU, 0.95, 0.85, +0.10]\n          - [S1_AUC, 0.55, 0.49, +0.06]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      QC-only是appendix-level robustness check。核心finding：\n      contamination质量影响magnitude但不影响direction——\n      gamma方向(MMLU+/ARC−/GSM8K≈0)在QC-only条件下identical。\n      这validates paraphrase quality不是confound。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f7fc5ed0-3b5c-4cd2-8f40-2efd640e4fc9","total_cost_usd":1.2793552499999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":45288,"cache_read_input_tokens":184874,"output_tokens":19583,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":45288,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":18665,"cache_read_input_tokens":47334,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9795,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9795},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":26598,"outputTokens":14195,"cacheReadInputTokens":1518040,"cacheCreationInputTokens":131909,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.4142632500000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":6,"outputTokens":19583,"cacheReadInputTokens":184874,"cacheCreationInputTokens":45288,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.865092,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"4c119eb4-f693-4d96-92b2-bda1cd049f8e"}
